    "summary": "Use it in the opponent's [Charge phase](vsdata:core-rule/charge-phase), right after an enemy unit declares a charge. Choose a **T’AU EMPIRE INFANTRY** unit of yours that is 1 of that charge's targets, and a friendly **TRANSPORT**.\n\nThe **INFANTRY** unit [embarks](vsdata:core-rule/embarking) in that **TRANSPORT**, but only if:\n\n- every model in it is within 3\" of the **TRANSPORT**\n- the **TRANSPORT** has enough **transport capacity** for the whole unit",
